                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 10,
                "retweet_count": 10,
                "source": "Hootsuite Inc.",
                "text": "Doctors should be making vital healthcare decisions, not number crunchers in high-rise buildings. The best thing we can do for doctors and patients is to streamline care. Read more about my bill reforming prior authorization requirements here:\n\nhttps://t.co/zkCMWwtZ3n",
