                "reply_count": 3,
                "retweet_count": 10,
                "source": "Twitter Web Client",
                "text": "Burdening physicians with administrative paperwork, especially during a doctor shortage, exacerbates the challenges faced by Medicare and Medicare Advantage. When 94% of doctors believe that a process is harming patient care, it must be taken seriously. That\u2019s why I introduced my Reducing Medically Unnecessary Delays in Care Act. My op-ed with @WashTimes:\n\nhttps://t.co/1rdg7hJ1bL",
